    <string name="accessibility_desc">CodeBubble: shows a bubble for codes copied to the clipboard. It does not read window content, it only checks the clipboard.</string>
    <string name="app_desc">Catches verification codes from SMS and app notifications.\n\n• When a code arrives, it is copied to the clipboard and a bubble appears.\n• Drag the bubble to move it.\n• Long-press the code and drag it onto a text field to drop the code there (if the field accepts it).\n• Tap the code to copy it again. × closes the bubble.\n\nThree permissions are needed: SMS, notification access, and display over other apps.</string>
